{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13470","headline":"蝉鸣一篇五章 四 · 宋华","name":"蝉鸣一篇五章 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蝉鸣伊何，时运未与。\n匪叹秋徂，怨斯路阻。\n愿言莫从，郁悒谁语。\n君子至止，慰我延伫。\n何斯违斯，倏尔遐举。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋华","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13470.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13470","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}